#. module: hr_payroll_expense
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_payroll_expense/models/account_move.py:0
msgid ""
"The '%(account_name)s' account for the salary rule '%(rule_name)s' must be "
"of type 'Payable'."
msgstr ""
"'%(account_name)s' 勘定科目、給与規則'%(rule_name)s' 用は、'買掛金'タイプであ"
"る必要があります。"

#. module: hr_payroll_expense
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_payroll_expense/models/product_template.py:0
msgid ""
"The salary rules linked to a product must have a debit account of type "
"'Liability Payable'.\n"
"Please fix the following salary rule(s): %s"
msgstr ""
"プロダクトに紐づいた給与規則には、種類が「支払負債」の借方勘定科目が設定され"
"ている必要があります。\n"
"次の給与規則を修正してください：%s"

#. module: hr_payroll_expense
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_payroll_expense/models/hr_expense.py:0
msgid "There are no valid expenses selected."
msgstr "有効な経費が選択されていません。"

#. module: hr_payroll_expense
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_payroll_expense/models/product_template.py:0
msgid ""
"You cannot assign multiple salary rules to the same structure for this "
"product.\n"
"Please fix the following structure(s): %s"
msgstr ""
"このプロダクトでは、同一の給与体系に複数の給与規則を割り当てることはできませ"
"ん。\n"
"次の給与体系を修正してください: %s"

#. module: hr_payroll_expense
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_payroll_expense/models/hr_expense.py:0
msgid ""
"You cannot remove an expense from a payslip that has already been "
"validated.\n"
"Expenses can only be removed from draft or canceled payslips."
msgstr ""
"すでに有効になっている給与明細書から経費を削除することはできません。\n"
"削除できるのは、ドラフトまたはキャンセルされた給与明細書からのみです。"

#. module: hr_payroll_expense
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_payroll_expense/models/hr_expense.py:0
msgid "You do not have permission to add this expense to a payslip."
msgstr "この経費を給与明細に追加する権限はありません。"

#. module: hr_payroll_expense
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_payroll_expense/models/hr_payslip.py:0
msgid ""
"You don't have the access rights to link an expense to a payslip. You need "
"to be a payroll officer to do that."
msgstr ""
"経費を給与明細にリンクするアクセス権限がありません。それを実行するには、給与"
"担当者に依頼する必要があります。"

#. module: hr_payroll_expense
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/hr_payroll_expense/models/account_move.py:0
msgid "You don't have the access rights to post an invoice."
msgstr "請求書を記帳するためのアクセス権がありません。"

